{"id":"986e317935e26442","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree.md","title":"ZFC Graph Rooted Tree","display":"df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree — ZFC Graph Rooted Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree — ZFC Graph Rooted Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-rooted-tree — ZFC Graph Rooted Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,E,r\\in V\">\\(V,E,r\\in V\\)</span> (vertex set, edge set, and root)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphRootedTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphRootedTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GraphPath}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GraphPath}_S\\)</span> (finite simple-path predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S\\)</span> (simple-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}simple\\text{-}path} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GraphPath}_S(p,u,v,V,E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Injection}_S(p,n+1,V)\\land p(0)=u\\land p(n)=v\\land\n\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\{p(i),p(i+1)\\}\\in E)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}simple\\text{-}path} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GraphPath}_S(p,u,v,V,E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Injection}_S(p,n+1,V)\\land p(0)=u\\land p(n)=v\\land\n\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\{p(i),p(i+1)\\}\\in E)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}rooted\\text{-}tree} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphRootedTree}_S(V,E,r)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land r\\in V\\land\n\\forall v\\in V\\;\\exists!p\\;\\mathrm{GraphPath}_S(p,r,v,V,E)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}rooted\\text{-}tree} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphRootedTree}_S(V,E,r)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land r\\in V\\land\n\\forall v\\in V\\;\\exists!p\\;\\mathrm{GraphPath}_S(p,r,v,V,E)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S$ (simple-graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$